pan lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143444\"><ruby>世界<rp>(</rp><rt>せかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはいろいろな<ruby>人種<rp>(</rp><rt>じんしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">世界上有很多不同的种族</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">人生</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じんせい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">人生；生涯</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202356\">できるあいだに<ruby>人生<rp>(</rp><rt>じんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>楽<rp>(</rp><rt>たの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しみなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">尽情享受生活吧</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">人物</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じんぶつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">人物；人；角色；人物形象；品格；性格；人品；能人；人才；有才能的人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230735\">あの<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどんな<ruby>人物<rp>(</rp><rt>じんぶつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>か<ruby>教<rp>(</rp><rt>おし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えて<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さい？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">告诉我那个人是什么样子的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">人類</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じんるい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">人类；人类社会</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143923\"><ruby>人類<rp>(</rp><rt>じんるい</