zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">水平；标准；水位</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"103486\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>水準<rp>(</rp><rt>すいじゅん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>満<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たしていなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他不符合标准</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">推薦</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すいせん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">推荐；推举；介绍</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225332\">ゲイのクラブを<ruby>推薦<rp>(</rp><rt>すいせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我在哪里能找到一个好同志俱乐部?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">スイッチ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">开关；按钮；转辙器；道岔；切换；转换；改变</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221847\">この<ruby>仕掛<rp>(</rp><rt>しか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けはスイッチで<ruby>動<rp>(</rp><rt>うご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个装置是用开关启动的。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/342198\" title=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">睡眠</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すいみん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">睡眠</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143609\"><ruby>睡眠<rp>(</rp><rt>すいみん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>薬<rp>(</rp><rt>くすり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>勝<rp>(</rp><rt>まさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">睡觉总比吃药好</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">数字</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すうじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">数字；数码；数值字符；数字；数目；数量；少数几个字</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"194674\">メーターの<ruby>数字<rp>(</rp><rt>すうじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>読<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">读一下计数器</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">末</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">末端；末梢；尖端；末期；月末；年末；幺子；最小的孩子；子孙；后代；后裔；未来；将来；经过……之后（终于）；……的最后；……之余；琐事；小事；微末之事；末世；衰世</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192778\">よく<ruby>考<rp>(</rp><rt>かんが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた<ruby>末<rp>(</rp><rt>すえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>いえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にいることに<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">经过深思熟虑后 我选择留在家里</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">姿</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すがた</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=